pi.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":118329629,"digest":"sha256:b6b71ecec3ba2d1558046d24d5dbfb9787c68b71620ff0d2fee408cebdd399a8","download_count":118,"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:42:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T14:43:56Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.1/Advancely-v1.5.1-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.5.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.5.1","body":"### This is a quick release with a few more features/fixes:\r\n\r\n  - **Ghost players**: Players with files in `advancements`/`stats`/`unlocks` but not in the lobby still count toward combined progress, and can be selected from the player dropdown.\r\n  - **Linked goals in multi-stage stages**: Auto-completion now extends to stage goals; **shells** (if wandering trader) and **trims** (if put directly into bundle) use that now everywhere.\r\n  - **Inverted goal hiding mode**: Goals can fade-in or brighten as they're completed instead of disappearing (AATool has that).\r\n  - **Custom completion threshold**: Useful for Half% and similar categories. Set a threshold for advancements/achievements AND/OR progress percentage at which the run will be treated as complete.\r\n  - **Bulk-layout improvements**: Individually adjustable positions, plus `Progress Pos.` available in bulk selection once a complex advancement/achievement is selected.\r\n  - **UI polish**: **use Game Capture** hint highlighted in orange next to Enable Overlay; \"Syncing for <Player>\" now also shows for offline/ghost players.\r\n  - Fixes: Hermes log redetected on new world creation; nested-popup Select/Deselect All respects search; `1.14` and `1.15` `all_advancements` renamed to `_optimized` variants; small polish done within the `1.16` `all_advancements` `_categorical` template.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}